<title>FINLAND: Finnish April jobless rate falls to 16.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish April jobless rate falls to 16.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's jobless rate fell to 16.1 percent in April from 17.3 percent in March, the Labour Ministry said in its monthly employment survey on Friday.</p>
<p>		     April 1997    March 1997    April 1996</p>
<p>    Unemployed     409,934     424,100	  444,100</p>
<p>    Jobless rate    16.1	  17.3		17.4</p>
<p>Five economists' average forecast for the April jobless rate measured by the labour ministry was 16.3 percent (range 16.1-16.4 pct). The ministry's data is not used in international comparisons.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
